t":"だいすきまいまい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は推しメン1位2位を争うくらいすき。。(｡-_-｡)まいみん。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい、ななみん、ねね\nの大人で落ち着いてるメンバーが好きなの(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやあ、握手のときも聖母でした。。♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむめいとの皆さんも、まいみんの皆さんも、楽しく握手してくれてありがとう！！\n優しい方ばかりで嬉しかったです(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また会いたいな〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/07/23/2732471/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8th東京個別"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/07/23/2732471/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/07/23/2732471/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/07/23/2732471/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピース:dazzlin"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにはシックにね♪\nこれまた褒められた(｡-_-｡)\nうれしかったです(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"列が見えた時嬉しさ倍増でした。。(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)\nもっともっと溢れるくらいの人で埋め尽くされるように、\nもっともっと頑張るって決めた握手会でした(´･_･`)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に来てくれてありがとう。\n支えてるのは皆さんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/07/23/2732471/0005.jpeg","alt":""}